<title>CANADA: Hawker Siddeley year net turns to profit.</title>
<headline>Hawker Siddeley year net turns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	C$2.42     loss	C$4.78</p>
<p> Net	 profit	20,000     loss	38,100</p>
<p> Revs			 1,700		    1,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Hawker Siddeley Canada Inc. 1996 results include a gain off C$14.0 million on the dilution of Hawker Siddeley's shareholding in BeaconEye Inc from 100 percent to 38.1 percent.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
